{"id":"n62491-1-20","stage":3,"title":"곁 · 边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62491-1-20-1","ko":"어? 가방이 바로 옆에 있었네?","zh":"咦？包不是就在旁边吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어?","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}},{"text":"가방이","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방이","audio":"/audio/3bacd65ffcbf66c44b88.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"바로：就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"7","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"옆에","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆에","audio":"/audio/f259a3ee3dd4d4a24841.mp3"}},{"text":"있었네?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었네","audio":"/audio/a035f5b1dfacb6c54435.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"就","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"时间上或空间上非常近地。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁，旁边","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"指左右两侧中的一侧。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/76f27b1bb8e140342a60.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62491-1-20-2","ko":"곁에 두고 없어졌다고 그 난리를 친 거야?","zh":"包就在你旁边，你却说不见了，还大惊小怪地闹成那样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곁에","meaning":"边，侧，左右","explanation":"곁：边，侧，左右；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"곁","audio":"/audio/00880385a95be6626727.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62491","senseId":"1","lemma":"곁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곁에","audio":"/audio/e4271c8711ef259fd2c5.mp3"}},{"text":"두고","meaning":"撇下，丢下，落","explanation":"두다：撇下，丢下，落；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"3","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두고","audio":"/audio/b825f2c9e380ab51c58d.mp3"}},{"text":"없어졌다고","meaning":"没有、不存在（없어지다：消失、不见了）；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"없다：没有、不存在（없어지다：消失、不见了）；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어졌다고","audio":"/audio/9b193784fbccf05f8c1a.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"난리를","meaning":"闹，胡闹","explanation":"난리：闹，胡闹；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"난리","audio":"/audio/5e90aba07c253992081d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16333","senseId":"2","lemma":"난리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난리를","audio":"/audio/92efe494c3f0266a156f.mp3"}},{"text":"친","meaning":"搞，干","explanation":"치다：搞，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"22","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친","audio":"/audio/297da9c1b1b603d9c530.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"00880385a95be662","term":"곁","zh":"边，侧，左右","audio":"/audio/00880385a95be6626727.mp3","entryId":"62491","definition":"某个对象的旁边；或指在其非常近的地方。","pronunciation":["겯"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"撇下，丢下，落","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不带走，遗留或丢弃。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有、不存在（없어지다：消失、不见了）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"没有、不存在（없어지다：消失、不见了）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"5e90aba07c253992","term":"난리","zh":"闹，胡闹","audio":"/audio/5e90aba07c253992081d.mp3","entryId":"16333","definition":"(喻义)因受惊或兴奋而大声喧哗。","pronunciation":["날ː리"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"搞，干","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"欺骗或折磨别人，或指做不好的举动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9aaebb1db5a5aa08910.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.785,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62491","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.2617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["咦？包不是就在旁边吗？","包就在你旁边，你却说不见了，还大惊小怪地闹成那样？","啊，敏俊没上课去哪儿了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["咦？包不是就在旁边吗？","包就在你旁边，你却说不见了，还大惊小怪地闹成那样？","啊，敏俊没上课去哪儿了？"],"answer":1}]}
